                <head>No. 135<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>During the period May 9–29, 1953 the focus of the Near Eastern policy of the
                    United States was on the visit to the Near and Middle East during that period of
                    the Secretary of State, John Foster Dulles. For documentation regarding this
                    trip, see <ref target="#d1">Documents 1</ref> ff.</p>
            </div>
